  "freshness": "The signed order, both Governor pages and EFF response remain materially unchanged. The September 23 adviser page still calls the shutoff and embedded-verifier requirements proposals under consideration; no universal switch, efficacy result or enacted amendment is established.",
  "freshnessEvidence": {
    "path": "operations/product-stewards/newsstand/candidates/california-ai-oversight-order-20260920/source-refresh-20260926.json",
